        "# 🔴 Portfolio Exercise 5: Smart Financial Planner & Tool-Calling Agent\n",
        "\n",
        "### 💼 Business Case & Real-World Context:\n",
        "Language models excel at understanding user intents but fail miserably at precise mathematical operations, often generating slightly incorrect values (hallucinations). An **Agentic Financial Advisor** delegates mathematical computations to a deterministic Python calculator tool while using LLM reasoning to parse input parameters and format human-friendly results.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 💡 Portfolio Showcase Tip:\n",
        "> **Why recruiters care:** Building **Agentic workflows** where LLMs dynamically choose, parameterize, and run external Python APIs represents the modern state-of-the-art in AI application development. This exercise showcases advanced understanding of LLM reasoning loops.\n",
        "\n",
        "---"
